{
  "key": 44594,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_WithPokemonSafeToTravelAlone",
      "en_US": [
        "If you’ve got Pokémon with you,\n",
        "it’s safe for even a kid like you\f",
        "to go off traveling alone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_MyPokemonsHPGotLow",
      "en_US": [
        "I had a battle the other day, and my\n",
        "Pokémon’s HP got low.\r",
        "I thought we were done for.\r",
        "And then, all of a sudden, my Pokémon\n",
        "ate the Berry it was holding! Whew!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_ProblemsWithElectricPower",
      "en_US": [
        "There’ve been problems with the\n",
        "electric power lately.\r",
        "Is there some trouble at the Valley\n",
        "Windworks?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_LongWayToEternaCity",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a long way from here to Eterna\n",
        "City.\r",
        "You should be prepared for a long\n",
        "journey."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_ArielIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Po-Po-Pokémon!\r",
        "I want to become more like a PIKACHU!\n",
        "Will you battle me?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_ArielBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": "Pi-Pikachu!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_ArielBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": "Pi-Pikachu!"
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_ArielPostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "I can make static electricity, but I’m\n",
        "not very much like a Pokémon yet.\r",
        "Don’t give up, me!\n",
        "Become a Pokémon, me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, you’re a Trainer.\r",
        "I’m with Jubilife TV.\n",
        "The Fun-and-Games TV Station...\r",
        "Do you want to answer five questions\n",
        "to get a reward?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerDeclined",
      "en_US": [
        "Great.\n",
        "I don’t need to bother then."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerRollCamera",
      "en_US": [
        "I guess you wouldn’t say no.\n",
        "OK, roll the camera...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWrong",
      "en_US": [
        "Yeah, sorry, that was wrong.\n",
        "Try again if you must."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "Yawn...\n",
        "You’ve won. Well done.\r",
        "Your prize is those three Pokémon\n",
        "I just battled you with.\r",
        "Talk to me when you want them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerPrizeIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Here’s your prize.\n",
        "Congratulations...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerBye",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, bye.\n",
        "I need a new job...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerCameraman",
      "en_US": [
        "Me? I’m a cameraman.\n",
        "I just do the filming."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerLetsFind",
      "en_US": [
        "Well done.\n",
        "Fourth question...\r",
        "Actually, you know what?\n",
        "This is really boring.\r",
        "Let’s just cut to the battle.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName1",
      "en_US": [
        "The Leaf Pokémon.\n",
        "Yay, it’s CHIKORITA...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived1",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a CHIKORITA!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname1",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this CHIKORITA?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName2",
      "en_US": [
        "The Fire Mouse.\n",
        "It’s CYNDAQUIL.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived2",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a CYNDAQUIL!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname2",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this CYNDAQUIL?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName3",
      "en_US": [
        "Big Jaw.\n",
        "TOTODILE.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived3",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a TOTODILE!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname3",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this TOTODILE?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNoRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "You haven’t got room in your party\n",
        "for all three. Can you hurry up\r",
        "and make some?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion1",
      "en_US": [
        "Here’s the first question...\r",
        "Is there a cave called Tohjo Falls\n",
        "within the Johto region?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion2",
      "en_US": [
        "Yes, that’s right.\n",
        "Second question, then.\r",
        "Does the Gym in Violet City give\n",
        "out the Feather Badge to Trainers?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion3",
      "en_US": [
        "Mhm.\n",
        "Third question.\r",
        "Can an Orange Apricorn be found\n",
        "within the Johto region?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
